{"data":[{"id":"5907","title":"Keep on reciting this Qur'an, for by the One in Whose Hand my soul is, the Qur'an slips away from memory faster than camels escaping their tying ropes","translations":["ar","bn","bs","en","es","fa","fr","id","ru","tl","tr","ur","zh","hi","ug","ku","ha","pt","ml","te","sw","my","th","de","ja","ps","vi","as","sq","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","si","ta","prs","hu","kn","ky","lt","mg","ro","rw","ne","sr","wo","so","mos","uk","bg","az","mr","ka","tg","bm","mk","am","om","km","pa","it","uz","ff","kmr","yao"]},{"id":"5913","title":"The best of you are those who learn the Qur\u2019an and teach it","translations":["ar","bn","bs","en","es","fa","fr","id","ru","tl","tr","ur","zh","hi","ug","ku","ha","pt","ml","te","sw","my","th","de","ja","ps","vi","as","sq","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","si","ta","prs","hu","kn","ky","lt","mg","ro","rw","ne","sr","wo","so","mos","uk","bg","az","ka","tg","bm","mk","am","om","km","mr","pa","it","uz","ff","kmr","yao"]},{"id":"6208","title":"Do not turn your houses into graves. Indeed, Satan runs away from the house in which Surat al-Baqarah is recited","translations":["ar","bs","en","fa","fr","id","ru","tr","ur","zh","hi","bn","es","ku","pt","ml","te","sw","ta","si","my","th","de","ja","ps","vi","as","sq","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ug","ha","prs","hu","kn","ky","lt","mg","ro","rw","ne","sr","so","mos","uk","bg","tl","wo","az","ka","tg","bm","mk","am","om","km","mr","pa","it","uz","ff","kmr"]},{"id":"6274","title":"Whoever recites the last two verses of S\u016brat al-Baqarah at a night, they will suffice him","translations":["ar","bs","en","fa","fr","id","ru","tr","ur","zh","hi","bn","ug","es","ku","ha","pt","ml","te","sw","ta","my","th","de","ja","ps","vi","as","sq","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","si","prs","hu","kn","ky","lt","mg","ro","rw","ne","sr","wo","so","mos","uk","bg","tl","az","ka","tg","bm","mk","am","km","mr","pa","it","uz","om","ff","kmr"]},{"id":"6275","title":"Whoever recites a letter from the Book of Allah will be c